alized device control.</p><p><br></p><p>Designed for durability and professional use, the GRP2602 offers secure communication, easy provisioning, and excellent audio clarity—making it ideal for any business telephony setup.</p><p><br></p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul><li>2-Line Carrier-Grade IP Phone</li><li>Supports up to 4 SIP Accounts</li><li>HD Voice with Full-Duplex Speakerphone</li><li>5-Way Audio Conferencing</li><li>Dual 10/100 Mbps Ethernet Ports</li><li>Advanced Noise Shield &amp; AI Noise Reduction</li><li>GDMS Cloud Device Management Support</li><li>Secure Boot &amp; Encrypted Data Storage</li><li>EHS Support for Headsets (Plantronics, Jabra, Sennheiser)</li><li>Zero-Touch Provisioning for Easy Setup</li><li>Power Adapter Included</li><li>Ideal for Office, Business &amp; Call Centers</li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"Dinstar C60SP Entry Level IP Phone with POE (Without Adapter)","href":"/dinstar-c60sp-entry-level-business-ip-phone","now":"3,400৳","old":"4,000৳","single":""},{"name":"SNOM C520 3-SIP PoE Black IP Conference Phone","href":"/snom-c520-3-sip-poe-black-ip-conference-phone","now":"33,000৳","old":"34,000৳","single":""},{"name":"Dinstar C60U Entry Level IP Phone with PoE and Adapter","href":"/dinstar-c60u-entry-level-ip-phone-with-poe-and-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"3,700৳"},{"name":"DINSTAR C62UP Color Screen IP Phone with POE & Without Adapter","href":"/dinstar-c62up-color-screen-ip-phone-with-poe-and-without-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"4,600৳"},{"name":"SNOM D305 4-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set without Adapter","href":"/snom-d305-4-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set-without-adapter","now":"","old":"","single":"4,290৳"},{"name":"SNOM D335 12-SIP PoE Desk Black IP Phone Set","href":"/snom-d335-12-sip-poe-desk-black-ip-phone-set","now":"","old":"","single":"13,800৳"},{"name":"SNOM D862 8-SIP PoE